BT /F2 12.50 Tf 52.00 781.00 Td (5.1 Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 761.38 Td (This project is a simple Tic-Tac-Toe simulator. Two players take turns and randomly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 747.20 Td (choose an empty place on the board.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 728.03 Td (Whenever a player gets three contiguous marks, that player earns one point. If the board) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 713.85 Td (fills up before either player completes a line, the round ends in a tie and nobody gets a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 699.68 Td (point.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 680.50 Td (To win the full game, a player must reach a target number of points. As soon as a player) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 666.33 Td (reaches that goal, the game stops. There is also a maximum number of rounds. If neither) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 652.15 Td (player reaches the point goal before the round limit, the game stops and the player with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 637.98 Td (the most points wins. If both players have the same score, the full game is tied.) Tj ET
