BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 225.63 Td (To avoid publishing local machine paths, the server reads its configuration from a local) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 211.45 Td (.env file. This file should not be committed because it contains machine-specific paths) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 197.28 Td (such as the Python interpreter, the game file, and the project folder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 52.00 178.10 Td (Create a .env file inside ssh_server/ with values similar to:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.20 Tf 64.00 154.93 Td (PYTHON_PATH=/absolute/path/to/.venv/bin/python) Tj ET
