BT /F3 8.20 Tf 64.00 133.33 Td (PROJECT_PATH=/absolute/path/to/tic_tac_toe) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.20 Tf 64.00 122.53 Td (HOST=0.0.0.0) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.20 Tf 64.00 111.73 Td (PORT=23234) Tj ET
